msgid "Login and recipients were accepted, but the email itself was refused – typically spam filtering, a sending limit or a policy of the provider (reply code 554)."
msgstr "Login dan penerima diterima, tetapi email itu sendiri ditolak – biasanya karena filter spam, batas pengiriman, atau kebijakan penyedia (kode balasan 554)."

msgid "Logs outgoing emails, maps the types of email your site sends and alerts you when one stops. Safe preview, delivery diagnostics, statistics."
msgstr "Mencatat email keluar, memetakan jenis email yang dikirim situs Anda, dan memberi tahu Anda saat salah satunya berhenti. Pratinjau aman, diagnosis pengiriman, statistik."

msgid "Look for an option to switch it off or to change its recipient in the email settings of %s – or ignore the type here."
msgstr "Cari opsi untuk menonaktifkannya atau mengubah penerimanya di pengaturan email %s – atau abaikan jenis ini di sini."

msgid "Look for the server reply in the error message; it usually names the reason."
msgstr "Cari balasan server di pesan galat; biasanya balasan itu menyebutkan alasannya."

msgid "Look for unexpected mass sending (spam form submissions, loops) in the log."
msgstr "Cari pengiriman massal yang tidak terduga (kiriman formulir spam, perulangan) di log."

msgid "Looking it up …"
msgstr "Sedang mencari …"

msgid "Lucas Wille"
msgstr "Lucas Wille"

msgid "Mail Log"
msgstr "Log Email"

msgid "Mail Log sections"
msgstr "Bagian Log Email"

msgid "Mail servers for replies and bounces are set up."
msgstr "Server email untuk balasan dan bounce sudah diatur."

msgid "Mailbox providers can verify that your site may send emails for this domain. The full sender check also looks at DKIM."
msgstr "Penyedia kotak surat dapat memverifikasi bahwa situs Anda boleh mengirim email untuk domain ini. Pemeriksaan pengirim lengkap juga memeriksa DKIM."

msgid "Mailbox unknown or unavailable"
msgstr "Kotak surat tidak dikenal atau tidak tersedia"

msgid "Mailer"
msgstr "Mailer"

msgid "Mailgun signs every webhook with this key (Sending → Webhooks → HTTP webhook signing key); reports without a valid signature are rejected."
msgstr "Mailgun menandatangani setiap webhook dengan kunci ini (Sending → Webhooks → HTTP webhook signing key); laporan tanpa tanda tangan yang valid akan ditolak."

msgid "Mailspur alerts"
msgstr "Peringatan Mailspur"

msgid "Mailspur checks the log for emails that could not be sent."
msgstr "Mailspur memeriksa log untuk email yang tidak dapat dikirim."

msgid "Mailspur found no order #%s in your shop."
msgstr "Mailspur tidak menemukan pesanan #%s di toko Anda."

msgid "Mailspur has logged %s delivered emails on this site so far. If it saves you time, a short review on WordPress.org would mean a lot – it helps others find the plugin and keeps it free."
msgstr "Sejauh ini Mailspur telah mencatat %s email terkirim di situs ini. Jika plugin ini menghemat waktu Anda, ulasan singkat di WordPress.org akan sangat berarti – ulasan membantu orang lain menemukan plugin ini dan menjaganya tetap gratis."

msgid "Mailspur has no email for order #%s in the log."
msgstr "Mailspur tidak memiliki email untuk pesanan #%s di log."

msgid "Mailspur has no email to %s in the log."
msgstr "Mailspur tidak memiliki email ke %s di log."

msgid "Mailspur is made by %1$s. Enjoying it? %2$s"
msgstr "Mailspur dibuat oleh %1$s. Suka? %2$s"

msgid "Mailspur learns how often each kind of email is sent, e.g. order confirmations, and reports here when one stops."
msgstr "Mailspur mempelajari seberapa sering setiap jenis email dikirim, mis. konfirmasi pesanan, dan melaporkannya di sini jika salah satunya berhenti."

msgid "Mailspur learns the rhythm of every email type from the last 8 weeks – a daily order confirmation is overdue after 2 days, a weekly report after 2 weeks. The alert names the type, its sender and the plugins updated since its last email. Uses the channels above; ignored types never alert."
msgstr "Mailspur mempelajari ritme setiap jenis email dari 8 minggu terakhir – konfirmasi pesanan harian dianggap terlambat setelah 2 hari, laporan mingguan setelah 2 minggu. Peringatan menyebutkan jenisnya, pengirimnya, dan plugin yang diperbarui sejak email terakhirnya. Menggunakan saluran di atas; jenis yang diabaikan tidak pernah memicu peringatan."

msgid "Mailspur sees that your site sent it, not the inbox itself. If it is not there, ask the recipient to check the spam folder."
msgstr "Mailspur melihat bahwa situs Anda mengirimnya, tetapi tidak melihat kotak masuknya. Jika email tidak ada di sana, minta penerima memeriksa folder spam."

msgid "Mailspur stops these emails now; their email type is ignored."
msgstr "Mailspur kini menghentikan email ini; jenis emailnya diabaikan."

msgid "Mailspur – Email Log"
msgstr "Mailspur – Log Email"

msgid "Mailspur: emails held"
msgstr "Mailspur: email ditahan"

msgid "Mailspur: staging mode"
msgstr "Mailspur: mode staging"

msgid "Main source: %1$s (%2$s emails)."
msgstr "Sumber utama: %1$s (%2$s email)."

msgid "Make sure the From address in the mailer plugin matches the verified domain."
msgstr "Pastikan alamat From di plugin mailer sesuai dengan domain yang terverifikasi."

msgid "Make sure the email is sent with \"charset=UTF-8\", template files are saved as UTF-8 and the database tables use utf8mb4. Fix texts that were already stored broken."
msgstr "Pastikan email dikirim dengan \"charset=UTF-8\", berkas templat disimpan sebagai UTF-8, dan tabel database menggunakan utf8mb4. Perbaiki teks yang sudah terlanjur tersimpan rusak."

msgid "Make sure the encryption setting matches the port."
msgstr "Pastikan pengaturan enkripsi sesuai dengan port."

msgid "Many emails could not be sent recently"
msgstr "Banyak email tidak dapat dikirim akhir-akhir ini"

msgid "Many exclamation marks in the subject (%1$s)"
msgstr "Banyak tanda seru di subjek (%1$s)"

msgid "Many mail clients block images until the reader allows them. Without alt text the reader only sees empty boxes; screen readers announce nothing useful."
msgstr "Banyak aplikasi email memblokir gambar sampai pembaca mengizinkannya. Tanpa teks alt, pembaca hanya melihat kotak kosong; pembaca layar tidak menyampaikan apa pun yang berguna."

