msgstr "Tandai sebagai selesai"

msgid "Marked as spam"
msgstr "Ditandai sebagai spam"

msgid "Marked as spam by the recipient"
msgstr "Ditandai sebagai spam oleh penerima"

msgid "Mask password-reset, activation and access keys in logged links as well as passwords, API keys and card numbers sent in plain text"
msgstr "Samarkan kunci reset kata sandi, aktivasi, dan akses dalam tautan yang dicatat, serta kata sandi, kunci API, dan nomor kartu yang dikirim sebagai teks biasa"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "Mungkin nanti"

msgid "Maybe the email was never sent – check the order status and the settings of your shop’s emails."
msgstr "Mungkin email itu tidak pernah dikirim – periksa status pesanan dan pengaturan email toko Anda."

