msgid "Protects your domain when far more emails leave than usual, e.g. because spam bots abuse a contact form. Alerts use the channels of the monitoring alerts; password reset emails are never held."
msgstr "Melindungi domain Anda saat jauh lebih banyak email keluar dari biasanya, mis. karena bot spam menyalahgunakan formulir kontak. Peringatan menggunakan saluran peringatan pemantauan; email reset kata sandi tidak pernah ditahan."

msgid "Provider status"
msgstr "Status penyedia"

msgid "Providers like %2$s publish a strict DMARC policy. An email \"from\" their domain that was sent by your web server fails that check and is rejected or lands in spam."
msgstr "Penyedia seperti %2$s memublikasikan kebijakan DMARC yang ketat. Email \"dari\" domain mereka yang dikirim oleh server web Anda akan gagal dalam pemeriksaan itu dan ditolak atau masuk ke spam."

msgid "Put the important content into real text and use images only in addition to it."
msgstr "Tuangkan konten penting dalam teks sungguhan dan gunakan gambar hanya sebagai pelengkap."

msgid "Put the important information first and keep the subject under about 80 characters."
msgstr "Letakkan informasi penting di awal dan jaga subjek di bawah sekitar 80 karakter."

msgid "REST API"
msgstr "REST API"

msgid "REST route"
msgstr "Rute REST"

msgid "Rarely"
msgstr "Jarang"

msgid "Rate Mailspur on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Beri nilai Mailspur di WordPress.org"

msgid "Raw source"
msgstr "Sumber mentah"

msgid "Reason"
msgstr "Alasan"

msgid "Rebuild from the log"
msgstr "Bangun ulang dari log"

msgid "Recipient"
msgstr "Penerima"

msgid "Recipient domain cannot receive email: %1$s"
msgstr "Domain penerima tidak dapat menerima email: %1$s"

msgid "Recipient domain does not accept email: %1$s"
msgstr "Domain penerima tidak menerima email: %1$s"

msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Penerima"

msgid "Recommended. Otherwise anyone with log access could use a logged reset link or password to take over an account. Resending such an email sends the masked version."
msgstr "Disarankan. Jika tidak, siapa pun yang memiliki akses log dapat memakai tautan reset atau kata sandi yang dicatat untuk mengambil alih akun. Mengirim ulang email seperti itu akan mengirim versi yang disamarkan."

msgid "Record for every email"
msgstr "Catat untuk setiap email"

msgid "Record for failed emails only"
msgstr "Catat hanya untuk email yang gagal"

msgid "Records the conversation with the SMTP server (only when emails are sent via SMTP). Login data and the message content are never recorded. Skipped while another plugin has SMTP debugging switched on."
msgstr "Mencatat percakapan dengan server SMTP (hanya jika email dikirim melalui SMTP). Data login dan isi pesan tidak pernah dicatat. Dilewati selama plugin lain mengaktifkan debugging SMTP."

msgid "Recovery"
msgstr "Pemulihan"

msgid "Redact secrets"
msgstr "Samarkan data rahasia"

msgid "Redirect all emails to the addresses below"
msgstr "Alihkan semua email ke alamat di bawah"

msgid "Redirect to"
msgstr "Alihkan ke"

msgid "Redirect to test addresses"
msgstr "Alihkan ke alamat uji"

msgid "Redirected by staging mode."
msgstr "Dialihkan oleh mode staging."

msgid "Reduce the HTML: remove unused CSS, inline styles that repeat, comments and long tracking URLs. Images are not counted, only the HTML itself."
msgstr "Kurangi HTML: hapus CSS yang tidak dipakai, gaya inline yang berulang, komentar, dan URL pelacakan yang panjang. Gambar tidak dihitung, hanya HTML-nya."

msgid "Registered users"
msgstr "Pengguna terdaftar"

msgid "Rejected by SPF, DKIM or DMARC"
msgstr "Ditolak oleh SPF, DKIM, atau DMARC"

msgid "Relative links or images (%1$s), e.g. %2$s"
msgstr "Tautan atau gambar relatif (%1$s), mis. %2$s"

msgid "Release held emails"
msgstr "Lepaskan email yang ditahan"

msgid "Released from staging (held entry #%s)."
msgstr "Dilepaskan dari staging (entri ditahan #%s)."

msgid "Released from the emergency brake (held entry #%s)."
msgstr "Dilepaskan dari rem darurat (entri ditahan #%s)."

msgid "Remote content"
msgstr "Konten eksternal"

msgid "Remote content is loaded."
msgstr "Konten eksternal dimuat."

msgid "Remote images and fonts are blocked so senders cannot track when you open this entry."
msgstr "Gambar dan font eksternal diblokir agar pengirim tidak dapat melacak kapan Anda membuka entri ini."

msgid "Remove all entries imported from %s? The data in the other plugin is not affected."
msgstr "Hapus semua entri yang diimpor dari %s? Data di plugin lain tidak terpengaruh."

msgid "Remove imported entries"
msgstr "Hapus entri impor"

msgid "Remove the card field from the notification of the form or plugin that sent this email – card data belongs to the payment provider only. Show at most the last four digits. Ask the recipient to delete the email."
msgstr "Hapus kolom kartu dari notifikasi formulir atau plugin yang mengirim email ini – data kartu hanya boleh ada di penyedia pembayaran. Tampilkan paling banyak empat digit terakhir. Minta penerima menghapus email tersebut."

msgid "Removed:"
msgstr "Dihapus:"

msgid "Repeat alerts after"
msgstr "Ulangi peringatan setelah"

msgid "Replies cannot reach you: sent from %1$s without Reply-To"
msgstr "Balasan tidak dapat sampai ke Anda: dikirim dari %1$s tanpa Reply-To"

msgid "Reported by your email provider in the last 30 days; only emails it reported on count."
msgstr "Dilaporkan oleh penyedia email Anda dalam 30 hari terakhir; hanya email yang dilaporkannya yang dihitung."

msgid "Request"
msgstr "Permintaan"

msgid "Request failed: %s"
msgstr "Permintaan gagal: %s"

msgid "Resend"
msgstr "Kirim ulang"

msgid "Resend the email from the log in a few minutes."
msgstr "Kirim ulang email dari log dalam beberapa menit."

msgid "Resend the email from the log later."
msgstr "Kirim ulang email dari log nanti."

msgid "Resend the email from the log once delivery works."
msgstr "Kirim ulang email dari log setelah pengiriman berfungsi."

msgid "Resend the failed emails once the limit resets."
msgstr "Kirim ulang email yang gagal setelah batasnya diatur ulang."

msgid "Resent from log"
msgstr "Dikirim ulang dari log"

msgid "Reset filters"
msgstr "Atur ulang filter"

msgid "Result"
msgstr "Hasil"

msgid "Result from the cache – use \"Check again\" after changing DNS records."
msgstr "Hasil dari cache – gunakan \"Periksa lagi\" setelah mengubah record DNS."

msgid "Retention"
msgstr "Masa simpan"

msgid "Retention in the log"
msgstr "Masa simpan di log"

msgid "Retention of this email type saved. It applies with the next daily cleanup."
msgstr "Masa simpan untuk jenis email ini disimpan. Berlaku pada pembersihan harian berikutnya."

msgid "Review held emails"
msgstr "Tinjau email yang ditahan"

msgid "Review the notes of this email (links, sender, placeholders)."
msgstr "Tinjau catatan email ini (tautan, pengirim, placeholder)."

msgid "Revoke the key in the service's dashboard and create a new one. Then find out why it ended up in an email (debug or error reports, a form that echoes settings) and stop that."
msgstr "Cabut kunci di dasbor layanan dan buat yang baru. Lalu cari tahu mengapa kunci itu sampai masuk ke email (laporan debug atau galat, formulir yang menampilkan pengaturan) dan hentikan."

msgid "Revoked keys (empty p=): %s."
msgstr "Kunci yang dicabut (p= kosong): %s."

msgid "Rhythm"
msgstr "Ritme"

msgid "Run a search & replace of the old domain in the database and check hard-coded URLs in email templates and plugin settings."
msgstr "Jalankan cari & ganti domain lama di database dan periksa URL yang ditulis langsung di templat email dan pengaturan plugin."

msgid "Run the full sender check"
msgstr "Jalankan pemeriksaan pengirim lengkap"

msgid "SMTP AUTH is disabled in Microsoft 365"
msgstr "SMTP AUTH dinonaktifkan di Microsoft 365"

msgid "SMTP host"
msgstr "Host SMTP"

msgid "SMTP login failed"
msgstr "Login SMTP gagal"

msgid "SMTP transcript"
msgstr "Transkrip SMTP"

msgid "SPF record allows every server in the world to send for this domain (+all)."
msgstr "Record SPF mengizinkan setiap server di dunia mengirim untuk domain ini (+all)."

msgid "SPF record ends with ?all (neutral): it does not protect the domain against spoofing."
msgstr "Record SPF diakhiri dengan ?all (netral): record ini tidak melindungi domain dari pemalsuan."

msgid "SPF record found (redirect= to another policy)."
msgstr "Record SPF ditemukan (redirect= ke kebijakan lain)."

msgid "SPF record found. Other servers are marked as suspicious (~all, softfail)."
msgstr "Record SPF ditemukan. Server lain ditandai mencurigakan (~all, softfail)."

msgid "SPF record found. Other servers are rejected (-all)."
msgstr "Record SPF ditemukan. Server lain ditolak (-all)."

msgid "SPF record has no \"all\" term, so mail from other servers is treated as neutral."
msgstr "Record SPF tidak memiliki istilah \"all\", sehingga email dari server lain dianggap netral."

msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "Sabtu"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "Simpan"

msgid "Saved – leave empty to keep it"
msgstr "Tersimpan – biarkan kosong untuk mempertahankannya"

msgid "Scheduled for later today:"
msgstr "Dijadwalkan untuk nanti hari ini:"

msgid "Search recipient or subject"
msgstr "Cari penerima atau subjek"

msgid "Search recipient or subject …"
msgstr "Cari penerima atau subjek …"

msgid "Search the email template, plugin settings and database for the old address (e.g. after migrating the site) and replace it with the live domain."
msgstr "Cari alamat lama di templat email, pengaturan plugin, dan database (mis. setelah migrasi situs) dan ganti dengan domain live."

msgid "See why"
msgstr "Lihat alasannya"

msgid "Seen"
msgstr "Dilihat"

msgid "Select all"
msgstr "Pilih semua"

msgid "Selector \"%s\" has no key either."
msgstr "Selektor \"%s\" juga tidak memiliki kunci."

msgid "Send"
msgstr "Kirim"

msgid "Send a link where the user sets a password instead – WordPress core's new-user email does exactly that. Look for an option such as \"Send password by email\" or \"Include password\" in the plugin that sent this email and turn it off."
msgstr "Kirim tautan agar pengguna mengatur kata sandinya sendiri – email pengguna baru dari inti WordPress melakukan hal itu. Cari opsi seperti \"Kirim kata sandi melalui email\" atau \"Sertakan kata sandi\" di plugin yang mengirim email ini dan nonaktifkan."

msgid "Send a message when the problem is resolved"
msgstr "Kirim pesan saat masalah teratasi"

msgid "Send a test email from the mailer plugin's settings."
msgstr "Kirim email uji dari pengaturan plugin mailer."

msgid "Send a weekly email report to the addresses above"
msgstr "Kirim laporan email mingguan ke alamat di atas"

msgid "Send again"
msgstr "Kirim lagi"

msgid "Send alerts by email to"
msgstr "Kirim peringatan melalui email ke"

msgid "Send all %s held emails to their original recipients now?"
msgstr "Kirim semua %s email yang ditahan ke penerima aslinya sekarang?"

msgid "Send large files as a download link instead of an attachment."
msgstr "Kirim berkas besar sebagai tautan unduhan alih-alih lampiran."

msgid "Send latest to me"
msgstr "Kirim yang terbaru ke saya"

msgid "Send newsletters with a newsletter plugin or service that adds List-Unsubscribe and List-Unsubscribe-Post headers, and do not send to many people in one email via Bcc."
msgstr "Kirim buletin dengan plugin atau layanan buletin yang menambahkan header List-Unsubscribe dan List-Unsubscribe-Post, dan jangan mengirim ke banyak orang dalam satu email melalui Bcc."

msgid "Send now"
msgstr "Kirim sekarang"

msgid "Send report now"
msgstr "Kirim laporan sekarang"

msgid "Send such emails to each recipient individually or put the recipients in Bcc. For newsletters use a newsletter plugin that sends one email per recipient. If customers' addresses were disclosed, check with your data protection officer whether the incident has to be reported."
msgstr "Kirim email seperti itu ke setiap penerima secara terpisah atau masukkan penerima ke Bcc. Untuk buletin, gunakan plugin buletin yang mengirim satu email per penerima. Jika alamat pelanggan telanjur terungkap, tanyakan kepada petugas perlindungan data Anda apakah insiden ini harus dilaporkan."

msgid "Send test alert"
msgstr "Kirim peringatan uji"

msgid "Send the email with the header \"Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\" or set the content type with the wp_mail_content_type filter. Many form and shop plugins have an \"HTML email\" option."
msgstr "Kirim email dengan header \"Content-Type: text/html; charset=UTF-8\" atau atur jenis konten dengan filter wp_mail_content_type. Banyak plugin formulir dan toko memiliki opsi \"email HTML\"."

msgid "Send the latest email of this type to %s?"
msgstr "Kirim email terbaru dari jenis ini ke %s?"

msgid "Send this email again to %s?"
msgstr "Kirim email ini lagi ke %s?"

msgid "Send this email to (up to 10 addresses, separated by commas):"
msgstr "Kirim email ini ke (maksimal 10 alamat, dipisahkan koma):"

msgid "Send this held email now to %s? Staging mode is bypassed for this one email."
msgstr "Kirim email yang ditahan ini sekarang ke %s? Mode staging dilewati untuk email ini saja."

msgid "Send through a reputable SMTP service instead of the web server, especially on shared hosting."
msgstr "Kirim melalui layanan SMTP tepercaya alih-alih server web, terutama di shared hosting."

msgid "Send to…"
msgstr "Kirim ke…"

msgid "Sender check (SPF, DKIM, DMARC)"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan pengirim (SPF, DKIM, DMARC)"

msgid "Sender domain %1$s differs from the site (%2$s)"
msgstr "Domain pengirim %1$s berbeda dari situs (%2$s)"

msgid "Sender domain (SPF and DMARC)"
msgstr "Domain pengirim (SPF dan DMARC)"

msgid "Sender domain or address not verified"
msgstr "Domain atau alamat pengirim belum terverifikasi"

msgid "Sender of %s of the last 200 emails"
msgstr "Pengirim %s dari 200 email terakhir"

msgid "Sending failed – see the log."
msgstr "Pengiriman gagal – lihat log."

msgid "Sending failed – see the new log entry for details."
msgstr "Pengiriman gagal – lihat entri log baru untuk detailnya."

msgid "Sending in the background (a mailer plugin with a queue) lets the page finish without waiting."
msgstr "Mengirim di latar belakang (plugin mailer dengan antrean) membuat halaman selesai dimuat tanpa menunggu."

msgid "Sending limit or quota reached"
msgstr "Batas pengiriman atau kuota tercapai"

msgid "Sending report …"
msgstr "Mengirim laporan …"

msgid "Sending test alert …"
msgstr "Mengirim peringatan uji …"

msgid "Sending works again: no more failure spike."
msgstr "Pengiriman berfungsi lagi: tidak ada lagi lonjakan kegagalan."

msgid "Sending…"
msgstr "Mengirim…"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Terkirim"

msgid "Sent as a free mail address: %1$s"
msgstr "Dikirim sebagai alamat email gratis: %1$s"

msgid "Sent by"
msgstr "Dikirim oleh"

msgid "Sent by WP-Cron."
msgstr "Dikirim oleh WP-Cron."

msgid "Sent by the cron event %1$s – it is overdue by %2$s while WP-Cron runs other events; it may fail with an error."
msgstr "Dikirim oleh event cron %1$s – event ini terlambat %2$s sementara WP-Cron menjalankan event lain; mungkin event ini gagal dengan galat."

msgid "Sent by the cron event %1$s – it is scheduled (next run in %2$s) and WP-Cron runs, so the event no longer sends this email."
msgstr "Dikirim oleh event cron %1$s – event ini terjadwal (berjalan berikutnya dalam %2$s) dan WP-Cron berjalan, jadi event ini tidak lagi mengirim email ini."

msgid "Sent by the cron event %s – this event is no longer scheduled."
msgstr "Dikirim oleh event cron %s – event ini tidak lagi terjadwal."

msgid "Sent by the cron event %s."
msgstr "Dikirim oleh event cron %s."

msgid "Sent repeatedly: %1$s more identical emails within %2$s minutes"
msgstr "Dikirim berulang: %1$s email identik lainnya dalam %2$s menit"

msgid "Sent to %s."
msgstr "Dikirim ke %s."

msgid "Sent to the same address around the order date, but not linked to this order (for example logged before the link existed, or imported)."
msgstr "Dikirim ke alamat yang sama sekitar tanggal pesanan, tetapi tidak ditautkan ke pesanan ini (misalnya dicatat sebelum tautan ada, atau diimpor)."

msgid "Set a Reply-To address that someone reads, e.g. in WooCommerce → Settings → Emails or in the email settings of your form plugin. Or send from an address that can receive replies."
msgstr "Atur alamat Reply-To yang dibaca seseorang, mis. di WooCommerce → Pengaturan → Email atau di pengaturan email plugin formulir Anda. Atau kirim dari alamat yang dapat menerima balasan."

msgid "Set a sender address on your domain in your SMTP plugin or via the wp_mail_from filter."
msgstr "Atur alamat pengirim pada domain Anda di plugin SMTP atau melalui filter wp_mail_from."

msgid "Set a sender address on your real domain, e.g. in your SMTP plugin or via the wp_mail_from filter, and check the site address under Settings → General."
msgstr "Atur alamat pengirim pada domain asli Anda, mis. di plugin SMTP atau melalui filter wp_mail_from, dan periksa alamat situs di Pengaturan → Umum."

msgid "Set a subject in the template or form settings of the sending plugin."
msgstr "Atur subjek di templat atau pengaturan formulir plugin pengirim."

msgid "Set the From address in your SMTP plugin to the mailbox you log in with and enable \"force From address\"."
msgstr "Atur alamat From di plugin SMTP Anda ke kotak surat yang Anda pakai untuk login dan aktifkan \"force From address\"."

msgid "Set up staging mode"
msgstr "Atur mode staging"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

msgid "Settings › Discussion"
msgstr "Pengaturan › Diskusi"

msgid "Several exclamation marks are typical of advertising spam. Spam filters may count this against the email, which can make delivery worse."
msgstr "Beberapa tanda seru adalah ciri khas spam iklan. Filter spam dapat menganggapnya sebagai nilai minus, yang dapat memperburuk pengiriman."

msgid "Several of the latest emails of this type failed."
msgstr "Beberapa email terbaru dari jenis ini gagal."

msgid "Share of failed emails per day (per week for long periods)."
msgstr "Persentase email gagal per hari (per minggu untuk periode panjang)."

msgid "Shop managers and above"
msgstr "Manajer toko ke atas"

msgid "Shortened links hide where they lead. Spammers use them a lot, so spam filters may count them against the email, which can make delivery worse."
msgstr "Tautan pendek menyembunyikan tujuannya. Spammer sering memakainya, sehingga filter spam dapat menganggapnya sebagai nilai minus, yang dapat memperburuk pengiriman."

msgid "Show all email types"
msgstr "Tampilkan semua jenis email"

msgid "Show all in Mail Log"
msgstr "Tampilkan semua di Log Email"

msgid "Show as"
msgstr "Tampilkan sebagai"

msgid "Show data as table"
msgstr "Tampilkan data sebagai tabel"

msgid "Show email types"
msgstr "Tampilkan jenis email"

msgid "Show emails"
msgstr "Tampilkan email"

msgid "Show emails for %s in the log"
msgstr "Tampilkan email untuk %s di log"

msgid "Show failed emails"
msgstr "Tampilkan email yang gagal"

msgid "Show held emails"
msgstr "Tampilkan email yang ditahan"

msgid "Show these emails in the log"
msgstr "Tampilkan email ini di log"

msgid "Silence"
msgstr "Keheningan"

msgid "Simulated dark mode, using the dark-mode styles of the email itself. Every mail app handles dark mode a little differently."
msgstr "Simulasi mode gelap menggunakan gaya mode gelap dari email itu sendiri. Setiap aplikasi email menangani mode gelap sedikit berbeda."

msgid "Simulation of apps that force dark mode by inverting the colours. Images keep their colours; real apps differ in detail."
msgstr "Simulasi aplikasi yang memaksakan mode gelap dengan membalik warna. Gambar tetap mempertahankan warnanya; aplikasi sebenarnya berbeda dalam detail."

msgid "Since 2024 Gmail and Yahoo require a one-click unsubscribe (List-Unsubscribe header) for bulk mail. Without it newsletters are more likely to be rejected or filtered."
msgstr "Sejak 2024 Gmail dan Yahoo mewajibkan berhenti berlangganan satu klik (header List-Unsubscribe) untuk email massal. Tanpanya, buletin lebih mungkin ditolak atau disaring."

msgid "Single failures, e.g. because of a mistyped address, are normal."
msgstr "Kegagalan sesekali, mis. karena salah ketik alamat, adalah hal yang wajar."

msgid "Some emails could not be sent recently"
msgstr "Beberapa email tidak dapat dikirim akhir-akhir ini"

msgid "Some lookups were skipped because DNS answered too slowly."
msgstr "Beberapa pencarian dilewati karena DNS menjawab terlalu lambat."

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page."
msgstr "Maaf, Anda tidak diizinkan mengakses halaman ini."

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "Maaf, Anda tidak diizinkan melakukan itu."

msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to export the mail log."
msgstr "Maaf, Anda tidak diizinkan mengekspor log email."

msgid "Source"
msgstr "Sumber"

msgid "Staging"
msgstr "Staging"

msgid "Staging mode"
msgstr "Mode staging"

msgid "Staging mode is active: all emails are redirected to %s."
msgstr "Mode staging aktif: semua email dialihkan ke %s."

msgid "Staging mode is active: emails are logged but not delivered."
msgstr "Mode staging aktif: email dicatat tetapi tidak dikirim."

msgid "Staging mode is active: emails should be redirected, but no valid redirect address is set – all emails are held and not delivered."
msgstr "Mode staging aktif: email seharusnya dialihkan, tetapi tidak ada alamat pengalihan yang valid – semua email ditahan dan tidak dikirim."

msgid "Staging mode is off"
msgstr "Mode staging nonaktif"

msgid "Staging mode is on although this is a live site"
msgstr "Mode staging aktif padahal ini situs live"

msgid "Staging mode is on for this staging site"
msgstr "Mode staging aktif untuk situs staging ini"

msgid "Staging mode is on: all emails go to your test addresses, not to the real recipients."
msgstr "Mode staging aktif: semua email dikirim ke alamat uji Anda, bukan ke penerima sebenarnya."

msgid "Staging mode is on: emails are logged but not sent."
msgstr "Mode staging aktif: email dicatat tetapi tidak dikirim."

msgid "Staging mode settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan mode staging"

msgid "Start with p=none to receive reports, then tighten to quarantine or reject once SPF and DKIM pass."
msgstr "Mulai dengan p=none untuk menerima laporan, lalu perketat ke quarantine atau reject setelah SPF dan DKIM lolos."

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Statistik"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "Status"

msgid "Still sorting %s older emails into types in the background. Reload the page in a minute."
msgstr "Masih memilah %s email lama ke dalam jenis di latar belakang. Muat ulang halaman dalam satu menit."

msgid "Stop bundling (sends what waits now)"
msgstr "Hentikan penggabungan (mengirim yang sedang menunggu sekarang)"

msgid "Stop these emails"
msgstr "Hentikan email ini"

msgid "Stopped"
msgstr "Berhenti"

msgid "Stopped by Mailspur."
msgstr "Dihentikan oleh Mailspur."

msgid "Stopped email types"
msgstr "Jenis email yang berhenti"

msgid "Store the exact raw MIME source of every email"
msgstr "Simpan sumber MIME mentah yang persis dari setiap email"

msgid "Subject"
msgstr "Subjek"

msgid "Subject mostly in capital letters"
msgstr "Subjek sebagian besar huruf kapital"

msgid "Subjects in capitals read like shouting and are common in spam. Spam filters may count this against the email, which can make delivery worse."
msgstr "Subjek berhuruf kapital terbaca seperti berteriak dan umum di spam. Filter spam dapat menganggapnya sebagai nilai minus, yang dapat memperburuk pengiriman."

msgid "Subjects often contain names or order numbers."
msgstr "Subjek sering berisi nama atau nomor pesanan."

msgid "Suggested TXT record for %s"
msgstr "Record TXT yang disarankan untuk %s"

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "Minggu"

msgid "Supported: %s."
msgstr "Didukung: %s."

msgid "Switch it off under %1$s: “%2$s”."
msgstr "Nonaktifkan di %1$s: “%2$s”."

msgid "Taken out of the daily digest and sent on its own."
msgstr "Dikeluarkan dari ringkasan harian dan dikirim tersendiri."

msgid "Temporary rejection – try again later"
msgstr "Penolakan sementara – coba lagi nanti"

msgid "Test"
msgstr "Uji"

msgid "Test alert"
msgstr "Peringatan uji"

msgid "Text changes"
msgstr "Perubahan teks"

msgid "Text version derived from the HTML. Whether the email also had its own plain-text version was not recorded."
msgstr "Versi teks yang diturunkan dari HTML. Apakah email juga memiliki versi teks biasanya sendiri tidak dicatat."

msgid "That is fine if your mail server is allowed to send for that domain. Otherwise SPF and DMARC fail and the email lands in spam."
msgstr "Itu tidak masalah jika server email Anda diizinkan mengirim untuk domain tersebut. Jika tidak, SPF dan DMARC gagal dan email masuk ke spam."

msgid "That is right for a test copy, but on a live site customers receive no order confirmations, password resets or answers to their forms. Turn staging mode off if this is the live site."
msgstr "Itu tepat untuk salinan uji, tetapi di situs live pelanggan tidak akan menerima konfirmasi pesanan, reset kata sandi, atau balasan atas formulir mereka. Nonaktifkan mode staging jika ini situs live."

msgid "The API key was rejected"
msgstr "Kunci API ditolak"

msgid "The DNS lookup failed or timed out. Try the sender check again later."
msgstr "Pencarian DNS gagal atau kehabisan waktu. Coba pemeriksaan pengirim lagi nanti."

msgid "The HTML email contains images but hardly any text. Spam filters cannot read images and distrust such emails, which can make delivery worse. If the mail client blocks images, the reader sees an almost empty email."
msgstr "Email HTML berisi gambar tetapi hampir tanpa teks. Filter spam tidak dapat membaca gambar dan mencurigai email seperti itu, yang dapat memperburuk pengiriman. Jika aplikasi email memblokir gambar, pembaca melihat email yang hampir kosong."

msgid "The SMTP account may only send with its own address (or verified aliases). WordPress or a plugin used a different From address."
msgstr "Akun SMTP hanya boleh mengirim dengan alamatnya sendiri (atau alias yang terverifikasi). WordPress atau sebuah plugin menggunakan alamat From yang berbeda."

msgid "The SMTP server conversation was empty."
msgstr "Percakapan dengan server SMTP kosong."

msgid "The SMTP server could not be reached at all: wrong host name or port, the server is down, or the web host blocks outgoing mail ports."
msgstr "Server SMTP sama sekali tidak dapat dijangkau: nama host atau port salah, server sedang mati, atau penyedia hosting memblokir port email keluar."

msgid "The SMTP server refuses to relay"
msgstr "Server SMTP menolak meneruskan"

msgid "The SMTP server rejected the user name or password (reply code 535)."
msgstr "Server SMTP menolak nama pengguna atau kata sandi (kode balasan 535)."

msgid "The SMTP server requires a login or encryption"
msgstr "Server SMTP memerlukan login atau enkripsi"

msgid "The address seems invalid – check it for typos or ask for another one."
msgstr "Alamat tampaknya tidak valid – periksa salah ketik atau minta alamat lain."

msgid "The body contains HTML tags, but the email was sent as text/plain (the WordPress default). Recipients see the raw tags instead of formatted text."
msgstr "Isi email berisi tag HTML, tetapi email dikirim sebagai text/plain (bawaan WordPress). Penerima melihat tag mentah alih-alih teks yang terformat."

msgid "The connection or the transfer took too long. Usually a firewall silently drops the connection, or host and port are wrong."
msgstr "Koneksi atau transfer memakan waktu terlalu lama. Biasanya firewall diam-diam memutus koneksi, atau host dan port salah."

msgid "The default sender address has no public domain, or this server cannot look up DNS records."
msgstr "Alamat pengirim bawaan tidak memiliki domain publik, atau server ini tidak dapat mencari record DNS."

msgid "The domain has neither an MX nor an A record in DNS. Emails to it bounce. Usually the address is misspelled or the domain no longer exists."
msgstr "Domain tidak memiliki record MX maupun A di DNS. Email ke domain itu akan bounce. Biasanya alamatnya salah eja atau domainnya sudah tidak ada."

msgid "The domain publishes a \"null MX\" record, which explicitly says that it receives no email. Every email to it bounces."
msgstr "Domain memublikasikan record \"null MX\", yang secara tegas menyatakan bahwa domain itu tidak menerima email. Setiap email ke domain itu akan bounce."

msgid "The email API answers slowly: check the region or endpoint configured in your mailer plugin."
msgstr "API email merespons lambat: periksa wilayah atau endpoint yang diatur di plugin mailer Anda."

msgid "The email comes from a no-reply address and has no Reply-To header. When a customer clicks \"Reply\", the answer goes to an address nobody reads, or it bounces."
msgstr "Email berasal dari alamat no-reply dan tidak memiliki header Reply-To. Saat pelanggan mengklik \"Balas\", jawabannya dikirim ke alamat yang tidak dibaca siapa pun, atau bounce."

msgid "The email contains a password in readable form. Emails stay in inboxes, backups and forwarded threads for years – anyone who gets hold of one of them can log in. The email log stores it as well, unless \"Redact secrets\" is on (then the log keeps a masked copy, but the recipient still got the password)."
msgstr "Email berisi kata sandi dalam bentuk yang dapat dibaca. Email tersimpan di kotak masuk, cadangan, dan utas yang diteruskan selama bertahun-tahun – siapa pun yang mendapatkannya dapat login. Log email juga menyimpannya, kecuali \"Samarkan data rahasia\" aktif (maka log menyimpan salinan yang disamarkan, tetapi penerima tetap mendapat kata sandinya)."

msgid "The email contains an access key (e.g. for Stripe, GitHub, Slack, AWS, Google or SendGrid) or a private key. Whoever reads the email – now or years later in an inbox or backup – can use it. The email log stores it as well, unless \"Redact secrets\" is on."
msgstr "Email berisi kunci akses (mis. untuk Stripe, GitHub, Slack, AWS, Google, atau SendGrid) atau kunci privat. Siapa pun yang membaca email ini – sekarang atau bertahun-tahun kemudian di kotak masuk atau cadangan – dapat menggunakannya. Log email juga menyimpannya, kecuali \"Samarkan data rahasia\" aktif."

msgid "The email contains template variables that were not filled in. Recipients see them literally."
msgstr "Email berisi variabel templat yang tidak terisi. Penerima melihatnya apa adanya."

msgid "The email contains what looks like a full payment card number (it passes the check-digit test). Card numbers must never be sent by email (PCI DSS): inboxes keep them for years. The email log stores it as well, unless \"Redact secrets\" is on."
msgstr "Email berisi sesuatu yang tampak seperti nomor kartu pembayaran lengkap (lolos uji digit pemeriksa). Nomor kartu tidak boleh dikirim melalui email (PCI DSS): kotak masuk menyimpannya selama bertahun-tahun. Log email juga menyimpannya, kecuali \"Samarkan data rahasia\" aktif."

msgid "The email is too large"
msgstr "Email terlalu besar"

msgid "The email links to WordPress files on a related host. This typically happens on a staging copy that still contains URLs of the live site – or the other way round."
msgstr "Email menautkan ke berkas WordPress di host terkait. Ini biasanya terjadi pada salinan staging yang masih berisi URL situs live – atau sebaliknya."

msgid "The email links to an address on this site that answers \"page not found\" (404). This typically happens after a page or product was renamed or deleted: the template still points to the old address and every recipient lands on an error page."
msgstr "Email menautkan ke alamat di situs ini yang menjawab \"halaman tidak ditemukan\" (404). Ini biasanya terjadi setelah halaman atau produk diganti nama atau dihapus: templat masih mengarah ke alamat lama dan setiap penerima berakhir di halaman galat."

msgid "The email types are being rebuilt from the log."
msgstr "Jenis email sedang dibangun ulang dari log."

msgid "The email went to several people outside your domain in To or Cc. Every recipient sees all other addresses. With customers or members this discloses personal data to strangers – under the GDPR usually a data breach."
msgstr "Email dikirim ke beberapa orang di luar domain Anda melalui To atau Cc. Setiap penerima melihat semua alamat lainnya. Untuk pelanggan atau anggota, ini mengungkap data pribadi kepada orang asing – menurut GDPR biasanya termasuk pelanggaran data."

msgid "The email “%1$s” to %2$s from %3$s at %4$s was briefly held back by a safety check on our side and sent afterwards. Please also check your spam folder."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” ke %2$s pada %3$s pukul %4$s sempat ditahan sebentar oleh pemeriksaan keamanan di pihak kami, lalu dikirim setelahnya. Silakan periksa juga folder spam Anda."

msgid "The email “%1$s” to %2$s from %3$s at %4$s was held back by a safety check on our side and has not been sent. We will send it again."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” ke %2$s pada %3$s pukul %4$s ditahan oleh pemeriksaan keamanan di pihak kami dan belum dikirim. Kami akan mengirimnya lagi."

msgid "The email “%1$s” to %2$s from %3$s at %4$s was not sent because sending emails was paused on our side at that time. We will send it again."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” ke %2$s pada %3$s pukul %4$s tidak dikirim karena pengiriman email sedang dijeda di pihak kami saat itu. Kami akan mengirimnya lagi."

msgid "The email “%1$s” to %2$s on %3$s at %4$s could not be delivered. We will send it again."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” ke %2$s pada %3$s pukul %4$s tidak dapat dikirim. Kami akan mengirimnya lagi."

msgid "The email “%1$s” to %2$s was created on %3$s at %4$s, but we cannot confirm whether it was delivered. We will check this and send it again if needed."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” ke %2$s dibuat pada %3$s pukul %4$s, tetapi kami tidak dapat memastikan apakah email tersebut sudah sampai. Kami akan memeriksanya dan mengirimnya lagi jika perlu."

msgid "The email “%1$s” was sent to %2$s on %3$s at %4$s and accepted by the mail server. Please also check your spam folder."
msgstr "Email “%1$s” dikirim ke %2$s pada %3$s pukul %4$s dan diterima oleh server email. Silakan periksa juga folder spam Anda."

msgid "The emergency brake holds outgoing emails until you release or discard them."
msgstr "Rem darurat menahan email keluar sampai Anda melepaskan atau membuangnya."

msgid "The emergency brake is holding emails"
msgstr "Rem darurat sedang menahan email"

msgid "The emergency brake is not holding any emails"
msgstr "Rem darurat tidak menahan email apa pun"

msgid "The emergency brake is on: your site suddenly sent far more emails than usual."
msgstr "Rem darurat aktif: situs Anda tiba-tiba mengirim jauh lebih banyak email dari biasanya."

msgid "The emergency brake noticed an unusual number of emails within one hour. A contact form may be abused. Emails are still being sent."
msgstr "Rem darurat mendeteksi jumlah email yang tidak biasa dalam satu jam. Formulir kontak mungkin disalahgunakan. Email masih tetap dikirim."

msgid "The exact raw source is stored – \"Download .eml\" returns it unchanged (not redacted)."
msgstr "Sumber mentah yang persis disimpan – \"Unduh .eml\" mengembalikannya tanpa perubahan (tidak disamarkan)."

msgid "The last %s emails all failed. Sending from this site may be broken, e.g. because of a wrong SMTP login or a mail service that refuses the site. Customers may not receive order confirmations or password resets."
msgstr "%s email terakhir semuanya gagal. Pengiriman dari situs ini mungkin rusak, mis. karena login SMTP salah atau layanan email yang menolak situs ini. Pelanggan mungkin tidak menerima konfirmasi pesanan atau reset kata sandi."

msgid "The latest emails could not be sent"
msgstr "Email terbaru tidak dapat dikirim"

msgid "The log keeps emails for %s day."
msgid_plural "The log keeps emails for %s days."
msgstr[0] "Log menyimpan email selama %s hari."

msgid "The log shows the reason for each failed email."
msgstr "Log menampilkan alasan untuk setiap email yang gagal."

msgid "The mail log requires JavaScript."
msgstr "Log email memerlukan JavaScript."

msgid "The mail server did not answer in time"
msgstr "Server email tidak menjawab tepat waktu"

msgid "The mail server is temporarily unavailable"
msgstr "Server email sementara tidak tersedia"

msgid "The mail server rejected the size of the email (reply code 552). Attachments grow by about a third when encoded."
msgstr "Server email menolak ukuran email (kode balasan 552). Lampiran bertambah sekitar sepertiga saat dikodekan."

msgid "The mail service only sends from domains or addresses you have verified there."
msgstr "Layanan email hanya mengirim dari domain atau alamat yang telah Anda verifikasi di sana."

msgid "The mail service or mailbox refused further emails because a rate limit, daily quota or plan limit was hit."
msgstr "Layanan email atau kotak surat menolak email berikutnya karena batas laju, kuota harian, atau batas paket tercapai."

msgid "The mail service refused the request because the API key is wrong, expired, revoked or lacks the permission to send."
msgstr "Layanan email menolak permintaan karena kunci API salah, kedaluwarsa, dicabut, atau tidak memiliki izin untuk mengirim."

msgid "The mailer plugin reported a failure"
msgstr "Plugin mailer melaporkan kegagalan"

msgid "The policy only applies to %s%% of the mail (pct)."
msgstr "Kebijakan hanya berlaku untuk %s%% email (pct)."

msgid "The reason: %s."
msgstr "Alasannya: %s."

msgid "The receiving server asked to retry later (reply code 450/451/452): greylisting, a full mailbox or too many emails in a short time."
msgstr "Server penerima meminta untuk mencoba lagi nanti (kode balasan 450/451/452): greylisting, kotak surat penuh, atau terlalu banyak email dalam waktu singkat."

msgid "The receiving server could not confirm that your server may send for the sender domain."
msgstr "Server penerima tidak dapat memastikan bahwa server Anda boleh mengirim untuk domain pengirim."

msgid "The receiving server does not know this mailbox (reply code 550 / 5.1.1) – the address is misspelled or no longer exists."
msgstr "Server penerima tidak mengenal kotak surat ini (kode balasan 550 / 5.1.1) – alamatnya salah eja atau sudah tidak ada."

msgid "The receiving server may still accept it on a later try."
msgstr "Server penerima mungkin masih menerimanya pada percobaan berikutnya."

msgid "The receiving server rejected the email because of its content or because the sending server's IP address is on a blocklist."
msgstr "Server penerima menolak email karena kontennya atau karena alamat IP server pengirim ada di daftar blokir."

msgid "The recipient address was rejected"
msgstr "Alamat penerima ditolak"

msgid "The recipient domain accepts no email (null MX)"
msgstr "Domain penerima tidak menerima email (null MX)"

msgid "The recipient domain has no mail server"
msgstr "Domain penerima tidak memiliki server email"

msgid "The recipient domain looks like a misspelling of a popular email provider. Such emails bounce – or reach a stranger who registered the typo domain."
msgstr "Domain penerima tampak seperti salah eja dari penyedia email populer. Email seperti itu akan bounce – atau sampai ke orang asing yang mendaftarkan domain salah ketik tersebut."

msgid "The same subject went to the same recipients several times in a short time. Typical causes are double order confirmations, a form submitted twice, a cron job running in parallel or a loop in a plugin."
msgstr "Subjek yang sama dikirim ke penerima yang sama beberapa kali dalam waktu singkat. Penyebab umumnya adalah konfirmasi pesanan ganda, formulir yang dikirim dua kali, cron job yang berjalan paralel, atau perulangan di sebuah plugin."

msgid "The secure connection to the SMTP server could not be established: the certificate does not match the host name, has expired, or the server does not support the chosen encryption."
msgstr "Koneksi aman ke server SMTP tidak dapat dibuat: sertifikat tidak cocok dengan nama host, sudah kedaluwarsa, atau server tidak mendukung enkripsi yang dipilih."

msgid "The sender address is not allowed"
msgstr "Alamat pengirim tidak diizinkan"

msgid "The sender check found a problem with %s. Emails may land in spam."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan pengirim menemukan masalah pada %s. Email bisa masuk ke spam."

msgid "The sender domain %s has SPF and DMARC records"
msgstr "Domain pengirim %s memiliki record SPF dan DMARC"

msgid "The sender domain could not be checked"
msgstr "Domain pengirim tidak dapat diperiksa"

msgid "The sender has no public domain (e.g. wordpress@localhost). Most mail servers reject such emails or put them in spam."
msgstr "Pengirim tidak memiliki domain publik (mis. wordpress@localhost). Sebagian besar server email menolak email seperti itu atau memasukkannya ke spam."

msgid "The server cannot send email with PHP mail()"
msgstr "Server tidak dapat mengirim email dengan PHP mail()"

msgid "The server closed the connection (reply code 421), e.g. because of maintenance, overload or too many connections from your server."
msgstr "Server menutup koneksi (kode balasan 421), mis. karena pemeliharaan, beban berlebih, atau terlalu banyak koneksi dari server Anda."

msgid "The server does not forward email for you, usually because you are not logged in or the sender address does not belong to the account."
msgstr "Server tidak meneruskan email untuk Anda, biasanya karena Anda belum login atau alamat pengirim bukan milik akun tersebut."

msgid "The server only accepts email after authentication or after switching to an encrypted connection (reply code 530)."
msgstr "Server hanya menerima email setelah autentikasi atau setelah beralih ke koneksi terenkripsi (kode balasan 530)."

msgid "The server rejected the content"
msgstr "Server menolak kontennya"

msgid "The server’s local mail program answers slowly: an SMTP or API mailer plugin hands emails to a provider instead."
msgstr "Program email lokal server merespons lambat: plugin mailer SMTP atau API akan menyerahkan email ke penyedia sebagai gantinya."

msgid "The start date must not be after the end date."
msgstr "Tanggal mulai tidak boleh setelah tanggal akhir."

msgid "The statistics require JavaScript."
msgstr "Statistik memerlukan JavaScript."

msgid "The text is the same; only the layout changed. Compare the previews."
msgstr "Teksnya sama; hanya tata letaknya yang berubah. Bandingkan pratinjaunya."

msgid "The user name is usually the full email address. Watch for spaces copied along with the password."
msgstr "Nama pengguna biasanya adalah alamat email lengkap. Perhatikan spasi yang ikut tersalin bersama kata sandi."

msgid "The webhook URL was removed: only valid https URLs are allowed."
msgstr "URL webhook dihapus: hanya URL https yang valid yang diizinkan."

msgid "The weekly report is enabled but has no recipient: enter an email address under “Send alerts by email to”."
msgstr "Laporan mingguan diaktifkan tetapi tidak memiliki penerima: masukkan alamat email di bawah “Kirim peringatan melalui email ke”."

msgid "These emails are sent again; their email type is monitored again."
msgstr "Email ini dikirim lagi; jenis emailnya dipantau lagi."

msgid "These kinds of email have not been sent for longer than usual. A plugin update, a changed setting or a stuck scheduled task may be the reason."
msgstr "Jenis email ini sudah lebih lama dari biasanya tidak dikirim. Penyebabnya mungkin pembaruan plugin, pengaturan yang berubah, atau tugas terjadwal yang macet."

msgid "This email has its own plain-text version, but the log does not store it. Shown here: a text version derived from the HTML."
msgstr "Email ini memiliki versi teks biasa sendiri, tetapi log tidak menyimpannya. Ditampilkan di sini: versi teks yang diturunkan dari HTML."

msgid "This email has no dark-mode styles of its own. Some apps show it unchanged, others recolour it – see Forced dark."
msgstr "Email ini tidak memiliki gaya mode gelap sendiri. Beberapa aplikasi menampilkannya tanpa perubahan, yang lain mewarnainya ulang – lihat Gelap paksa."

msgid "This email has no plain-text version – some clients and spam filters prefer one. Shown here: a text version derived from the HTML."
msgstr "Email ini tidak memiliki versi teks biasa – beberapa aplikasi email dan filter spam lebih menyukainya. Ditampilkan di sini: versi teks yang diturunkan dari HTML."

msgid "This email type has no content change."
msgstr "Jenis email ini tidak memiliki perubahan konten."

msgid "This email type is ignored now: no status, no alerts."
msgstr "Jenis email ini kini diabaikan: tanpa status, tanpa peringatan."

msgid "This email type is monitored again."
msgstr "Jenis email ini dipantau lagi."

msgid "This entry was anonymised; its content can no longer be sent."
msgstr "Entri ini telah dianonimkan; kontennya tidak dapat dikirim lagi."

msgid "This import is already running in another tab."
msgstr "Impor ini sudah berjalan di tab lain."

msgid "This is a test alert. Your alert channels work."
msgstr "Ini adalah peringatan uji. Saluran peringatan Anda berfungsi."

msgid "This production site sent a link to a local or test address. Recipients cannot open it."
msgstr "Situs produksi ini mengirim tautan ke alamat lokal atau uji. Penerima tidak dapat membukanya."

msgid "This question requires JavaScript. You can search the log instead."
msgstr "Pertanyaan ini memerlukan JavaScript. Sebagai gantinya, Anda dapat mencari di log."

msgid "This site keeps a log of emails it sends (recipient, subject, content and delivery status) to verify delivery and troubleshoot problems. Log entries are deleted automatically after the configured retention period."
msgstr "Situs ini menyimpan log email yang dikirimnya (penerima, subjek, konten, dan status pengiriman) untuk memverifikasi pengiriman dan memecahkan masalah. Entri log dihapus secara otomatis setelah masa simpan yang dikonfigurasi."

msgid "This site runs as a %s environment, and staging mode keeps its emails from reaching real people."
msgstr "Situs ini berjalan sebagai lingkungan %s, dan mode staging mencegah emailnya sampai ke orang sungguhan."

msgid "This site runs as a %s environment. Turn on staging mode so that no real customer gets an email from it."
msgstr "Situs ini berjalan sebagai lingkungan %s. Aktifkan mode staging agar tidak ada pelanggan sungguhan yang menerima email darinya."

msgid "Threshold (emails per hour)"
msgstr "Ambang batas (email per jam)"

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "Kamis"

msgid "Timeline"
msgstr "Linimasa"

msgid "To"
msgstr "Kepada"

msgid "To date"
msgstr "Sampai tanggal"

msgid "To keep them but get only one email a day, choose “Bundle into one daily email” in the … menu of the type."
msgstr "Untuk tetap menerimanya tetapi hanya satu email sehari, pilih “Gabungkan menjadi satu email harian” di menu … pada jenis tersebut."

msgid "Top lists are based on the latest %s emails of this period."
msgstr "Daftar teratas didasarkan pada %s email terbaru dalam periode ini."

msgid "Top recipient domains"
msgstr "Domain penerima teratas"

msgid "Top recipients: %s"
msgstr "Penerima teratas: %s"

msgid "Top sources"
msgstr "Sumber teratas"

msgid "Top subjects"
msgstr "Subjek teratas"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "Total"

msgid "Total: %s ms"
msgstr "Total: %s md"

msgid "Trace"
msgstr "Jejak"

msgid "Transcript copied."
msgstr "Transkrip disalin."

msgid "Transport"
msgstr "Transport"

msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Picu"

msgid "Trigger a real password reset email for your own account? WordPress creates a new reset link for you, so earlier reset links stop working; your password stays the same. Only %s receives it."
msgstr "Picu email reset kata sandi sungguhan untuk akun Anda sendiri? WordPress membuat tautan reset baru untuk Anda, sehingga tautan reset sebelumnya tidak berfungsi lagi; kata sandi Anda tetap sama. Hanya %s yang menerimanya."

msgid "Trigger the new user notifications for your own account (the notice to the administrator and the login details)? WordPress creates a new password link for you, so earlier links stop working. No user is created; only %s receives them."
msgstr "Picu notifikasi pengguna baru untuk akun Anda sendiri (pemberitahuan ke administrator dan detail login)? WordPress membuat tautan kata sandi baru untuk Anda, sehingga tautan sebelumnya tidak berfungsi lagi. Tidak ada pengguna yang dibuat; hanya %s yang menerimanya."

msgid "Trigger to me"
msgstr "Picu ke saya"

msgid "Triggering…"
msgstr "Memicu…"

msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "Selasa"

msgid "Type"
msgstr "Jenis"

msgid "Types are updated hourly and whenever you open this page. Only counters, subject patterns and content fingerprints are stored (no recipients, no contents), and they follow the retention period of the log."
msgstr "Jenis diperbarui setiap jam dan setiap kali Anda membuka halaman ini. Hanya penghitung, pola subjek, dan sidik jari konten yang disimpan (tanpa penerima, tanpa isi), dan semuanya mengikuti masa simpan log."

msgid "Typo in recipient domain? %1$s → %2$s"
msgstr "Salah ketik di domain penerima? %1$s → %2$s"

msgid "Umlauts or quotes appear as garbled characters such as \"Ã¤\" or \"â€™\". UTF-8 text was read as a different character set somewhere on the way – in a template, an import or the database."
msgstr "Umlaut atau tanda kutip tampil sebagai karakter acak seperti \"Ã¤\" atau \"â€™\". Teks UTF-8 dibaca sebagai set karakter lain di suatu tempat dalam prosesnya – di templat, impor, atau database."

msgid "Unclear. “%1$s” to %2$s was handed over for sending %3$s, but Mailspur got no result back."
msgstr "Tidak jelas. “%1$s” ke %2$s diserahkan untuk dikirim %3$s, tetapi Mailspur tidak menerima hasilnya."

msgid "Under Tools"
msgstr "Di bawah Alat"

msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Copot pemasangan"

msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Tidak diketahui"

msgid "Unknown probe."
msgstr "Uji coba tidak dikenal."

msgid "Unknown: no delivery result was reported (replaced wp_mail() function?)."
msgstr "Tidak diketahui: tidak ada hasil pengiriman yang dilaporkan (fungsi wp_mail() diganti?)."

msgid "Unreplaced placeholders: %1$s"
msgstr "Placeholder yang tidak terganti: %1$s"

msgid "Until the log limit"
msgstr "Sampai batas log"

msgid "Up to 10 addresses, separated by commas. Cc and Bcc are removed and the subject shows the original recipients. Without a valid address, emails are held instead."
msgstr "Maksimal 10 alamat, dipisahkan koma. Cc dan Bcc dihapus dan subjek menampilkan penerima asli. Tanpa alamat yang valid, email akan ditahan."

msgid "Up to 5 addresses, separated by commas. Alert emails appear in the log with the source “Mailspur alerts” and never trigger alerts themselves."
msgstr "Maksimal 5 alamat, dipisahkan koma. Email peringatan muncul di log dengan sumber “Peringatan Mailspur” dan tidak pernah memicu peringatan sendiri."

msgid "Update the link in the email template or in the settings of the plugin that sends this email, or add a redirect from the old address to the new page (e.g. with a redirection plugin)."
msgstr "Perbarui tautan di templat email atau di pengaturan plugin yang mengirim email ini, atau tambahkan pengalihan dari alamat lama ke halaman baru (mis. dengan plugin pengalihan)."

msgid "Updated in between: %s"
msgstr "Diperbarui di antaranya: %s"

msgid "Updated since the last one:"
msgstr "Diperbarui sejak yang terakhir:"

msgid "Updated since then: %s."
msgstr "Diperbarui sejak saat itu: %s."

msgid "Use TLS on port 587 or SSL on port 465."
msgstr "Gunakan TLS di port 587 atau SSL di port 465."

msgid "Use a descriptive link text (e.g. \"View order\") or show the address the link really leads to."
msgstr "Gunakan teks tautan yang deskriptif (mis. \"Lihat pesanan\") atau tampilkan alamat tujuan tautan yang sebenarnya."

msgid "Use a sender address on your own domain and put the free address in Reply-To. Only if you really send through that provider's own SMTP server with its login is this fine."
msgstr "Gunakan alamat pengirim pada domain Anda sendiri dan masukkan alamat gratis tersebut ke Reply-To. Ini hanya boleh jika Anda benar-benar mengirim melalui server SMTP milik penyedia itu dengan login-nya."

msgid "Use absolute URLs including https:// and the domain, e.g. with home_url() or wp_get_attachment_url() in the template."
msgstr "Gunakan URL absolut termasuk https:// dan domain, mis. dengan home_url() atau wp_get_attachment_url() di templat."

msgid "Use exactly the host name the certificate was issued for (e.g. the provider's smtp.… host instead of an IP or your own domain)."
msgstr "Gunakan nama host yang persis sama dengan yang tercantum di sertifikat (mis. host smtp.… milik penyedia alih-alih IP atau domain Anda sendiri)."

msgid "Use one exclamation mark at most."
msgstr "Gunakan paling banyak satu tanda seru."

msgid "Use the arrow keys to move between cells."
msgstr "Gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah antarsel."

msgid "Use the arrow keys to move between values, Enter to open them in the log."
msgstr "Gunakan tombol panah untuk berpindah antarnilai, Enter untuk membukanya di log."

msgid "Use the mailbox address of the SMTP account as sender (From)."
msgstr "Gunakan alamat kotak surat akun SMTP sebagai pengirim (From)."

